WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.851
Hi! I'm Bruna. Meet my family and my neighbors!

2
00:00:05.301 --> 00:00:08.273
This is my sister, Sara. She's twenty-five.

3
00:00:08.723 --> 00:00:13.181
She has long curly brown hair and brown eyes. She's always on her phone!

4
00:00:15.431 --> 00:00:19.007
This is my neighbor, Mr. Gomes. He's sixty-five.

5
00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:23.312
He has short white hair and a grey beard. He isn't bald!

6
00:00:25.562 --> 00:00:29.137
This is my cousin, Lucy. She's young and slim.

7
00:00:29.587 --> 00:00:31.538
She has short straight blond hair.

8
00:00:33.788 --> 00:00:37.968
And this is my grandmother, Rosa. She's old. She's eighty-two!

9
00:00:38.418 --> 00:00:41.808
She has white hair and a lot of wrinkles, and she cooks very well.

10
00:00:44.058 --> 00:00:47.680
And this is my nephew, Tom. He's ten, and he's short.

11
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.916
He has short blond hair, and he loves soccer.

12
00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:56.092
And you? Describe a person in your family!

